  "id": "brioche-bread-and-butter-pudding",
  "name": "Brioche Bread-and-Butter Pudding",
  "subtitle": "A rich baked pudding with rum-soaked fruit",
  "description": "Brioche rolls, sultanas, and a creamy egg custard bake into a warm British-style pudding, finished with a simple cream sauce.",
  "meal_type": "dessert",
  "cuisine": "british",
  "yield": {
